{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46964","headline":"怀金陵李推官僧自牧 · 齐己","name":"怀金陵李推官僧自牧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秣陵长忆共吟游，儒释风骚道上流。\n莲幕少年轻谢朓，雪山真子鄙汤休。\n也应有作怀清苦，莫谓无心过白头。\n欲附别来千万意，病身初起向残秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}